<div class="home-page">
  <section class="home-hero">
    <p class="home-eyebrow">PERSONAL SPACE · KNOWLEDGE · CREATION</p>
    <h1>你好，我是 Kui。</h1>
    <p class="home-lead">在这里记录技术、阅读与思考。<br class="desktop-break">把零散的灵感整理成知识，把长期的积累变成作品。</p>
    <div class="home-actions">
      <a class="home-button home-button-primary" href="<%- url_for("archives") %>">阅读文章 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      <a class="home-button" href="https://github.com/ilikui" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看 GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="home-topics" aria-label="关注领域">
      <span>嵌入式与汽车电子</span><span>知识管理</span><span>阅读与写作</span><span>个人项目</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section" aria-labelledby="home-explore-title">
    <div class="home-section-heading">
      <div><p class="home-kicker">EXPLORE</p><h2 id="home-explore-title">从这里开始</h2></div>
      <p>一些常用入口，快速找到想看的内容。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="home-entry-grid">
      <a class="home-entry" href="<%- url_for("archives") %>">
        <span class="home-entry-number">01 / READ</span><span class="home-entry-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        <h3>文章与随笔</h3><p>技术笔记、读书记录，以及对生活和世界的持续观察。</p><span class="home-entry-link">浏览全部文章 →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="home-entry" href="https://github.com/ilikui" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <span class="home-entry-number">02 / BUILD</span><span class="home-entry-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌘</span>
        <h3>开源与项目</h3><p>把学习过程沉淀为代码、工具和可以持续改进的作品。</p><span class="home-entry-link">访问 GitHub →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="home-entry" href="https://wiki.likui.info/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <span class="home-entry-number">03 / KNOW</span><span class="home-entry-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌁</span>
        <h3>个人知识库</h3><p>连接笔记、问题、案例与实践，让知识能够被再次使用。</p><span class="home-entry-link">进入知识库 →</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section home-writing" aria-labelledby="home-writing-title">
    <div class="home-section-heading">
      <div><p class="home-kicker">LATEST NOTES</p><h2 id="home-writing-title">最近写作</h2></div>
      <a class="home-more" href="<%- url_for("archives") %>">全部文章 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
    <ul class="home-post-list">
      <% var home_posts = site.posts.sort('date', 'desc').limit(5); %>
      <% home_posts.each(function(post){ %>
        <li class="home-post-item">
          <span class="home-post-date"><%- date(post.date, 'YYYY.MM.DD') %></span>
          <a href="<%- url_for(post.path) %>"><%= post.title %></a>
          <span class="home-post-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </li>
      <% }); %>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="home-note">
    <span class="home-note-mark" aria-hidden="true">✳</span>
    <div><p class="home-kicker">A SMALL REMINDER</p><p class="home-note-text">持续积累，持续创造。<span>让每一次记录，都成为下一次思考的起点。</span></p></div>
  </section>
</div>
